12:
Guard stop state\n
Runchain opened by any safety guard\n
except the emergency stop.\n
\t\n
Close runchain, it could be broken\n
by the following devices (if used):\n
Access gate, light screen, servo\n
disconnector or any other safety\n
device connected to the run chain.

13:
Emergency stop state\n
Runchain opened by emergency stop.\n
Em stop reset is required.\n
Use the motors off button.\n
\t\n

14:
System failure state\n
Fatal non recoverable system error.\n
Warm start is required.\n
\t\n

15:
Manual mode selected\n
\t\n

16:
Automatic mode requested\n
\t\n

17:
