\t\n

20:
Execution error state\n
The program execution has reached\n
a spontaneous error state\n
\t\n

21:
Execution error reset\n
The program execution has left\n
a spontaneous error state\n
\t\n

22:
Hold to run waiting\n
Waiting for hold to run button to be\n
pressed on the programming unit.\n
\t\n

23:
Hold to run timeout\n
The hold to run button on the\n
programming unit must be pressed\n
within timeout limit.\n
\t\n

