51:
Event routine error\n
The task %!%s could not start\n
the specified system event routine\n
%s\n
The routine is either unknown to\n
the system or unlinkable.\n
\t\n
Insert the routine in a system\n
module or correct the program.
52:
Regain start\n
A regain movement has started\n
\t\n

53:
Regain ready\n
The regain movement is ready\n
\t\n

54:
Regain rejected\n
Regain on path not possible one client\n
has already order it.\n
\t\n
A new regain movement is ordered during\n
an already started regain movement.\n
Reduce the number of start order from\n
e.g system I/O

60:
Test of enable chain\n
The enable chain is always tested at\n
startup. If the test failed an error\n
message concerning enable will follow.\n
\t\n
If enable chain test at startup failed\n
the related error message will be\n
"Enable chain timeout"\n

